  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/501cd60bd3f700c955487e0caf303a2df8173cef.png\" alt=\"Minecraft 數據包：拴繩柵欄與電線模組\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/z2n3qTzQY6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/refs/heads/main/badges/Discord.png\" alt=\"jodeks Discord - Discord 圖示 - 像素風格圖示 - 像素 Discord 圖示 - jodeks 數據包 - 數據包 Discord\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/YouTube.png\" alt=\"jodek 數據包 YouTube\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Armor-Stand-Arms/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/blob/main/badges/GH_Issues.png?raw=true\" alt=\"拴繩柵欄 Minecraft 數據包 GitHub 問題回報\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/blob/main/badges/Kofi.png?raw=true\" alt=\"jodeks 數據包 Ko-fi - jodek Ko-fi - Minecraft 數據包 Ko-fi 贊助\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/Jodekq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/blob/main/badges/GH_Sponsor.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub 贊助者 jodek 捐款 數據包 Minecraft\"></a></p>\n<h2>運作方式</h2>\n<p><strong>1.</strong> 蹲下並手持拴繩右鍵點擊柵欄</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong> 將拴繩繫於任意其他柵欄上</p>\n<h2>功能展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/blob/main/gifs/leash_fences_1.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/Assets/blob/main/gifs/leash_fences_1.gif?raw=true\"></p>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<p>目前 Minecraft 存在一項錯誤（自 1.21.6 版本起）：當拴繩跨越區塊邊界拉長，且被拴住實體所在的區塊（即您最初連接拴繩的柵欄柱所在區塊）內有玩家死亡時，拴繩會斷裂。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252freport.bugs.mojang.com%252fservicedesk%252fcustomer%252fportal%252f2%252fMC-300654\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://report.bugs.mojang.com/servicedesk/customer/portal/2/MC-300654</a></p>",
